                *path operation*.

                Read more about it in the
                [FastAPI docs for Dependencies in path operation decorators](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/dependencies/dependencies-in-path-operation-decorators/).
                """
            ),
        ] = None,
        summary: Annotated[
